  "name": "analyzing-task-runs",
  "description": "Split a completed PostHog task run into activity records — what the agent tried, whether it worked, what blocked it — and record each one through the report_activity tool. Use when a task asks to analyze a run, produce a task analysis, or review a run from an attached run log. Covers the log query protocol (bounded jq queries over the raw JSONL), both log schemas, the activity schema, and evidence verification. Records facts only; it does not suggest fixes.",
